Z||000000||Fiero_24||12-25-2001||08:42 AM||||This is a factory authorized conversion done from 1983 to 1986.  The rear deck lid swings backward to reveal the convertible top.  The top is a clamshell, hard/soft.  I have no idea, but mine has Callaway emblems on it.  They are moulded in the door handles, and there are a few stickers that say Callaway too.  This was made by Autoform in Indiana, and was only offered for brand new vehicles.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1983.jpg"> <BR><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/driverside41.jpg"> <BR>  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fiero_24</A> <BR>1987 GT||||reg||1
